function showSimulationChooser(brief=null,fromProject=false){pendingBroker=null;simulationDraft=brief?normalizeBrokerBrief(brief):null;simulationFromProject=fromProject;$('#simulationQuickFields').hidden=!!simulationDraft;$('#simulationQuickOptions').hidden=!!simulationDraft;$('#simulationBriefSummary').hidden=!simulationDraft;$('#simulationRefresh').hidden=!!simulationDraft;$('#simulationManual').hidden=!simulationDraft||fromProject;if(simulationDraft){const b=simulationDraft;$('#simulationBriefSummary').innerHTML=`<b>Same needs for all three spaces:</b> ${esc(b.people)} workstations · ${esc(b.meetingRooms)} meeting rooms${b.meetingRooms?` × ${esc(b.roomSeats)} seats`:''} · ${esc(b.offices)} offices · ${esc(b.phones)} phone booths · ${esc(b.extraSpaces.length)} additional space types. Each card assesses its best generated concept; open a space for A/B/C and the full requirement trace.`}$('#brokerIntake').hidden=true;$('#brokerReport').hidden=true;$('#welcomeModal').hidden=true;$('#simulationModal').hidden=false;renderSimulations()}
const showSimulationChooserBase=showSimulationChooser;
showSimulationChooser=function(brief=null,fromProject=false){showSimulationChooserBase(brief,fromProject);$('#decisionSite').innerHTML='<option value="">Choose a space</option>'+simulatedCandidates().map(site=>`<option value="${site.id}">${esc(site.name)}</option>`).join('');$('#decisionReason').value='';$('#decisionError').textContent=''};
function renderSimulations(){const brief=simulationBrief(),candidates=simulatedCandidates(),previews=simulationPreviews(brief);$('#simulationResults').innerHTML=candidates.map((c,index)=>{const preview=previews[index],gaps=preview.gaps,open=preview.unassessed+preview.clarify,remaining=Math.max(0,gaps.length-2),status=gaps.length?'bad':open?'warn':'ok',label=gaps.length?`${gaps.length} hard requirement gap(s)`:open?'No counted gap · incomplete review':'No counted gap · concept only',detail=gaps.length?gaps.slice(0,2).map(row=>`${row.name}: ${row.actual} / ${row.required}`).join(' · ')+(remaining?` · +${remaining} more`:''):'Counted items have no shortfall in this concept.';return `<article class="simulation-card"><small>${esc(c.fit)}</small><h2>${esc(c.name)}</h2><p><b>${c.area} m²</b> · ${(c.width/1000).toFixed(1)} × ${(c.height/1000).toFixed(1)} m</p><div class="simulation-thumb" role="img" aria-label="Concept preview of ${esc(c.name)}">${preview.thumbnail}</div><span class="fit-status ${status}">${esc(label)}</span><p class="fit-detail"><b>Best concept:</b> ${esc(preview.best)}</p><p class="fit-detail">${esc(detail)}</p><p class="fit-detail">${open?`${open} to clarify`:'No client questions'} · ${preview.conceptReview} concept placement${preview.conceptReview===1?'':'s'} to verify</p><button class="btn" data-simulation="${c.id}">View 3 layouts in this space</button></article>`}).join('')}
function openSimulation(candidateId,brief=simulationBrief()){const candidate=simulatedCandidates().find(c=>c.id===candidateId);if(!candidate)return;snapshot();P=makeSimulationProject(candidate,brief);$('#simulationModal').hidden=true;$('#decisionModal').hidden=true;$('#welcomeModal').hidden=true;syncBrokerBrief();generateDrafts();fit()}
